      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Headache research has been a productive area, and understanding of primary headache pathophysiology has increased greatly. There are many more questions that need to be answered to gain a better understanding of the primary headache process. For the clinician,there is value in understanding the pathophysiology of primary headache, because this understanding can help improve diagnostic acumen and shape treatment plans to provide patients with more effective treatment."},
